                <h3 class="faq__question text-xl font-bold mb-4 text-text-primary dark:text-text-strong-dark">Do I own my website?</h3>
                <p class="faq__answer text-lg text-text-secondary dark:text-text-secondary-dark leading-relaxed">Yes. We build your website upfront and spread the cost over a 12-month subscription. Once the minimum term is complete, the website itself is yours.</p>
