            <div class="faq__item bg-bg-surface dark:bg-bg-surface-dark rounded-xl p-8 shadow-lg border border-border-standard dark:border-border-standard-dark transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-xl hover:-translate-y-1">
                <h3 class="faq__question text-xl font-bold mb-4 text-text-primary dark:text-text-strong-dark">What happens during the subscription?</h3>
                <p class="faq__answer text-lg text-text-secondary dark:text-text-secondary-dark leading-relaxed">While your subscription is active, we host and fully manage your website. This includes updates, performance, and support, so you do not need to deal with any technical setup.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="faq__item bg-bg-surface dark:bg-bg-surface-dark rounded-xl p-8 shadow-lg border border-border-standard dark:border-border-standard-dark transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-xl hover:-translate-y-1">
                <h3 class="faq__question text-xl font-bold mb-4 text-text-primary dark:text-text-strong-dark">What happens if I cancel after 12 months?</h3>
                <p class="faq__answer text-lg text-text-secondary dark:text-text-secondary-dark leading-relaxed">If you cancel after the minimum term, we stop hosting and managing the site. You can request a static copy of your website and host it elsewhere if you wish.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="faq__item bg-bg-surface dark:bg-bg-surface-dark rounded-xl p-8 shadow-lg border border-border-standard dark:border-border-standard-dark transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-xl hover:-translate-y-1">
                <h3 class="faq__question text-xl font-bold mb-4 text-text-primary dark:text-text-strong-dark">What if I cancel early?</h3>
